hackberrypi-max17048-dkms (1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Overlay: sda/scl-gpios open-drain, bus pinned to i2c-11, simple-battery
    node, runtime parameters, opt-in hw_i2c.
  * Driver: chip presence check, cached snapshot, notify on change, PM ops,
    smoothed CRATE, Full hysteresis.
  * Maintainer scripts rewritten: atomic dtbo install, config.txt backup and
    marker block, nothing destructive on upgrade.
  * Overlay: RP1 Ethernet disabled by default (not routed on the Q20 board;
    `ethernet` re-enables it); new `i2c_hz` parameter for the hw_i2c bus clock.
  * tools/stage-tryboot.sh: stage the overlay plus fan-curve and display
    config.txt tuning for a one-shot tryboot test.
  * postinst mirrors the overlay into <os_prefix>overlays/ when config.txt
    sets os_prefix (the firmware loads it from there); postrm removes it.
  * Maintainer scripts find dtmerge in /usr/local/bin under sudo's
    secure_path, so merge validation no longer silently skips.

 -- CNflysky <cnflysky@qq.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

